            <span class="font-semibold text-white">⚡ 晚高峰稳定专线推荐</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">0 丢包深港/沪日物理专线</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/shadowrocket-airport/" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 hover:text-cyan-300 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
