          </a>
          <a href="/apple-id/" class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-emerald-500/20 hover:border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-300 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between">
            <span class="font-semibold text-white">🍎 小火箭共享 ID 账号</span>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">美区 Apple ID 每日免费共享</span>
